{"obsah":"<p>This year's first exhibition at a ball, for the motorbike gang of the Bikes4life project, which organises events for bikers and much more. Martin Šimůnek went to the event and also sorted out where to put the obstacles, and Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček came with Tobík Dolák from indoor training in Germany. A great bunch of people, a packed venue and plenty of time to show how to fool around and jump on a bike. Thanks for the invitation, ladies and gentlemen.</p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F01%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-01-26-at-20.08.28.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F01%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-01-26-at-20.08.28.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250312\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F01%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-01-26-at-20.08.47.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F01%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-01-26-at-20.08.47.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250310\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F01%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-01-26-at-20.09.04.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F01%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-01-26-at-20.09.04.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250315\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a hre